// Acid oak-birch woodland on free-draining sandy soil: sessile oak and silver birch share the canopy; maple, which needs base-rich soil, is absent.
// Shipped preset (ADR-2456); its ecology profile is the `.ecology.ron` beside it.
BiomeDef(
    format_version: 1,
    name: "Oak-birch woodland",
    color: (0.42, 0.5, 0.22),
    priority: 20,
    layers: [
        (
            name: "canopy",
            rank: 30,
            sharing: Exclusive,
